      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You'll want to frame the audit not as a critique, but as a confirmation of their existing strength, which then necessitates even greater protection. Suggest that their current setup is robust, but that the 'Advanced Continuous Monitoring' is the necessary next evolution to preempt *future*, unforeseen threats. Position it as proactive insurance against the sophisticated attacks that even the best systems can miss.",
